  ))
  The panels show the strategy trajectories $(x_1^((t)), y_1^((t)))$ over $10^5$ iterations. The Nash equilibrium is at $(1\/(1 + delta), 1\/(2(1 + delta))) approx (0.990, 0.495)$, very close to the right edge. The marks $times$ and #sym.square.filled show the times $T_1$ and $T_2$ defined below.
]

